      "writtenOn": "2020-07-08T09:00:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean to use `VisitAllModules` in a singleton as below instead of using soong deps check for different variations?\n\n```\nVisitAllModules(func(module Module){\n    version :\u003d module.getVersion()\n    ctx.VisitDirectDeps(module, func(dep Module) {\n        if version !\u003d dep.getVersion() {\n            fmt.Errorf(\"Dependency between the versions is not allowed.\")\n        }\n    })\n})\n```\nIf it is more efficient than creating a variation, let me update with it. Or do you have a different idea?",
